   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( p(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{x + 1}{2}} \\) and \\( q(x) = \\frac{x}{3} - \\frac{8}{3} \\). Let R be the region bounded by the graphs of p and q and the x-axis. By integrating with respect to y, find the exact area of R.",
